xcluded\": [\n   \"The engine's own worker loop, node.save and the node-level snapshot state are not exercised; the probe isolates the launch wrapper that the question names.\",\n   \"No raft node, nodehost, transport, log write or state machine participates.\",\n   \"The probe does not test what the process would do after a recovered panic, because the observation is the process outcome itself.\"\n  ]\n },\n \"prefix\": \"The test checks for a marker environment variable. In the child it creates a stopper with the syncutil constructor, launches a worker that prints a start event and then panics with a fixed message, sleeps briefly, prints a survival event if it is still running,\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
